rds and frameworks</div><h3 style="margin:0 0 7px;font:600 18px/1.3 Georgia,serif"><a href="https://daily.security.admin.news/day/2026-11-06/#doc-2026-11-06-microsoft-security-adoption-framework-saf-04" style="color:#11181d;text-decoration:none">SAF now links strategy through measurement</a></h3></td></tr></table><p style="margin:5px 0 0;color:#46514e;font:14px/1.55 Arial,sans-serif">The SAF page now connects business priorities, risk, Zero Trust principles, security disciplines, technologies, and technical solutions, and adds guidance on shared responsibilities, implementation, measurement, and four connected framework components across hybrid, multicloud, and multiplatform environments.</p></div><div style="margin:0 0 20px;padding:0 0 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #d8d3c7"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width:100%;border:0;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td width="46" valign="top" style="width:46px;min-width:46px;padding:1px 8px 0 0;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap"><img src="https://daily.security.admin.news/assets/products/security-adoption.svg" width="20" height="20" alt="" style="display:inline-block;width:20px!important;max-width:20px!important;height:20px!important;max-height:20px!important;object-fit:contain;vertical-align:middle"><span style="display:inline-block;width:5px"></span><img src="https://daily.security.admin.news/assets/topics/general.svg" width="16" height="16" alt="" style="display:inline-block;width:16px!important;max-width:16px!important;height:16px!important;max-height:16px!important;object-fit:contain;vertical-align:middle"></td><td valign="top" style="padding:0;vertical-align:top"><div style="margin:0 0 5px;color:#0d5745;font:700 11px/1.35 Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase">Security adoption · General</div><h3 style="margin:0 0 7px;font:600 18px/1.3 Georgia,serif"><a href="https://daily.security.admin.news/day/2026-11-06/#doc-2026-11-06-using-saf-ef